      <title>3.8.2 (382.3.2)</title>
      <link>https://github.com/jayjay181818/StockBar/releases/tag/experimental-382.3.2</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:34:11 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>382.3.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.8.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:channel>experimental</sparkle:channel>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.4.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">Experimental build 382.3.2 of Stockbar 3.8.2. Changes since experimental-380.0.1:

- Say "Couldn't reach Folync" on the Performance tab's portfolio charts
- Keep the settings-transfer tests' defaults in memory
- Release 3.8.2
- Name a stale Folync chart and count any connection failure as unreachable
- Say when Folync can't be reached
- Draw the saved Folync chart while Folync is asked for a newer one
- Release 3.8.1
- Never take net deposits from a stale cached history
- Measure portfolio P&amp;L against net deposits
- Show when a cached quote was fetched, not when it was read
- Save price alerts' last checked prices once per refresh
- Correct the Folync and exchange-rate intervals; keep the wiki in step
- Make the docs match the app
- Link the wiki from the README
- chore(python): update locked packages</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/jayjay181818/StockBar/releases/download/experimental-382.3.2/Stockbar-382.3.2.zip" length="7225945" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="hW9XLSYOP7eeMktyJsdDVigFHgrjGaVIawKy4f7AgRf32h3RXAOp7w45qDkvrjTvYdPLblhJ/8V60/xRBxaNCg=="></enclosure>
